# --- The instrument never enters git ---------------------------------------
# 40 of the 60 questions, the answer key, the seal files and the blinding keys
# stay out of any published tree. A benchmark dies the day its questions enter
# a training corpus, and the quantity this one measures — what a model knows
# without the corpus — is precisely the quantity contamination destroys.
# Deny by default; two files are allowed back.
instrument/*
!instrument/README.md
!instrument/MANIFEST.sha256

# --- Campaign raw material --------------------------------------------------
# Candidate copies, blinded copies, judge dossiers, keys, salted copies.
# Each copy answers all 60 questions, so publishing the copies publishes the
# sealed questions. The control stratum is extracted into public/ instead.
campaigns/*/raw/

# --- Corpus and its derivatives ---------------------------------------------
# Not ours to redistribute, and regenerable. See PROTOCOL.md § Corpus.
corpus/
*.pdf

__pycache__/
.venv/
*.pyc

# Worktrees of other sessions live here; never tracked.
.claude/worktrees/
